  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">School and Community Water, Sanitation and Hygiene (SC-WASH) in Pursat Province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed build adaptive capacity and resilience through improved access to safe water, improved sanitation and hygiene in community and school behaviours changed. The specific objectives are (i) Community capability to access safe drinking water and household latrines is strengthened, (ii) The communities practice environmentally healthy behavior, and, (iii) The villages, the district and provincial government and relevant stakeholders have strong to participating in WASH service providers to rural area.</narrative>
  </description>
